<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 377 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 377 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 377 contracts compared with 566 overnight Sunday.</p>
<p>There were 19 wheat, 197 corn, 146 soybean, two soymeal, seven oat, one rice, four corn puts and one soybean call traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1/2 to one cent higher, corn was steady to 1/2 cent higher and soybeans were steady to 1/2 cent lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
